", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sALwjuF352EQ7kNvwEgCkrj&_nc_oc=Adpyqj09fmN_0r2QVqPldbQU_peIms7dMEPnFBINQO5jynR022bHfmbSU4qoQCSIFJI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3eet3qWkTFFtyUtEzlXxbMWsl6TyZTy5larKP7TtG-uw&oe=69E38979"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YUhvjxwjp9MQ7kNvwF23eNi&_nc_oc=AdpAhJSdaGV4qPIEupy4Nz8Wws18jK8TgF2YmsiyBbPDHlwRLQjh71SVWTNDy1SnnI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3jQQcZ_lf5gVcQb32H7qlD3gfeZ94dfGyQpjDpXxkgLQ&oe=69E3680B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3jOe2-mlrrsQ7kNvwHkasIk&_nc_oc=AdrIWT9LeeEUsFhpgqUxEM56hJo_8xwhlsK_yEQFOQ__v5Lgd5k64rDAwsFEJDrZWE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1xlbzX_lLfb6H66pxTpRaVMtC2KivzN1M7vEfdtpBnkg&oe=69E3668E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel